### 注册
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "测试用户"
}

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 获取用户信息
GET http://localhost:8081/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改密码
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "123456"
}

### 获取分类列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/category/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取分类列表（仅支出）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/category/list?type=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取分类列表（仅收入）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/category/list?type=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 添加记账（支出）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 35.00,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "remark": "午餐"
}

### 添加记账（收入）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": 1,
  "amount": 5000,
  "categoryId": 11,
  "remark": "兼职收入"
}

### 记账列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expense/list?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 记账列表（仅支出筛选）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expense/list?type=0&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 记账详情
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expense/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改记账
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/expense/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 50.00,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "remark": "早餐"
}

### 删除记账
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/expense/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 分类统计（5月支出，饼图数据）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expense/statistics/category?type=0&startDate=2026-05-01&endDate=2026-05-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 分类统计（5月收入，饼图数据）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expense/statistics/category?type=1&startDate=2026-05-01&endDate=2026-05-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 月度趋势（柱状图数据）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expense/statistics/monthly?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### AI 对话

POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "我这个月支出最多的是哪一类？有什么省钱建议？"
}